{"version":1,"key":"card:160","content":{"id":160,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 Canvas 绘制路径，包括直线和曲线。一个画直线的🌰："}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"ctx.beginPath()\nctx.moveTo(100, 100)\nctx.lineTo(100, 200)\nctx.stroke()","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"1c67f360-dab1-487f-a42e-2cc9225dce61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面牵涉到四个方法："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"beginPath","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：开始绘制一个路径"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"moveTo","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：设置绘制的起点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"lineTo","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：画一条连接上一个位置到指定位置的线段"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"stroke","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：绘制线段"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在调用 ","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"stroke","code":true,"bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法之前，都没有真正的在画布上划线，只是将这些指令记录下来，只有调用了 ","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"stroke","code":true,"bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法之后，才会依次运行这些指令，在画布上绘制。","bold":true}]}],"tags":["Canvas"],"createTime":1690289623563,"updateTime":1743303640406,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640406}}